ame": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 7.5   Mana Cost: 50", "desc": "Bane swallows a cup of sea ink, recovering 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> (+ 5<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+1.5% Total Magic Power)</span>% his lost HP), gaining 50% Movement Speed that decays over 2.5s.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Use Again</span>: Bane spits corrosive ink in a fan-shaped area, dealing 140<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+130% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> (up to 200% with charging time).\n\nEvery 100 <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">Magic Power</span> Bane possesses reduces this skill's cooldown by 7%."}, {"name": "Deadly Catch", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_fe8c4a45d27cc7d56b893a31138b8a4d.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 40   Mana Cost: 120", "desc": "Bane summons a school of sharks to charge in the target direction, dealing 700<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit, knocking them airborne for 0.6s, and slowing them by 75% (decays over 3s).\nThis skill deals 40% damage to turrets."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Holy Crystal", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_25c17fb08406548b8476673ce7fc3078.png"}, {"name": "Lightning Truncheon", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ff18dc8e5abef3934886191fe6c161a0.png"}, {"name": "Blood Wings", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8635fde5353c9c68778e2aa59b931844.png"}, {"name": 